Explain fixtures and yield with example?

@pytest.fixture
def login_page(page):
  page.goto("www.google.com")
  page.fill("username","admin")
  page.fill("password","23434")
  page.click("button",type='submit'")
  yield page

def create_user(login_page):
  login_page.click("text="create_user")

Everything before yield is the set up and everything after the yield is teasr down. 
